rows.35:dbe8:
That white dot... no, that white mass had eyes and a mouth.
It was a face{f:!|!}
Just a pure-white face, floating in the dark{f:.|.}
The face looked at {f:me|me} with resentment.{p}

rows.35:e128:
{f:I|I} had decided not to go{f:.|.}
Tagging along after Hino now would just be galling{f:.|.}
So {f:I|I} didn't stand up{f:.|.}{p}

rows.35:e2d0:
I looked around the room.
The club room had suddenly gone so empty.
Did the shadow in the corner just move, for an instant{f:?|?}
Didn't I just hear a faint noise from the lockers{f:?|?}
Even when I tried to tell myself it was my imagination, the unease welling up deep in my chest wouldn't go away.
..........What should I do?
Should I go after Hino and the others now?
I might still catch up with them.
The moment I thought that, {f:I|I} sprang to my feet on reflex.
I dashed out of the club room.{p}

rows.35:ebac:
With great effort, I managed to lift just my head.
My arms and legs were strapped to something like an operating table!
What was going on{f:?|?}
I heard a cold voice.
"Relax. This is nothing more than a little experiment."
{f:I|I} searched for the owner of the voice.{p}

rows.35:eec8:
My face itched.
My face had started itching like crazy.
It felt like dozens of ants were crawling all over my face{f:.|.}
{f:I|I} jerked violently at my strapped-down arms.
The skin rubbed raw, and blood seeped out.
But compared to this itching...!{p}

rows.35:efbc:
"{a}, I'm sorry!
Shirai threatened me: if I didn't bring him victims, he'd make me drink the bacteria.
I didn't know what it would do, and I was scared...
I'm so sorry!"
Far away, I could hear Hino's voice, half sobbing.
I didn't care about any of that{f:!|!}
Just make this itching stop{f:!|!}
It itches!
It itches!
It itches so much I'm going to die{f:|}☆{p}

rows.35:f114:
{f:I|I} kept yanking at my arms like mad.
Then, suddenly, one arm came free.
The rope had snapped{f:!|!}
Ignoring my bloody wrist, {f:I|I} scratched my face as hard as I could.
I scratched, and scratched, and scratched.
The instant I scratched it felt good, but right away an itch worse than before would attack me again{f:.|.}
{f:I|I} couldn't stop my hands anymore.
As I kept scratching frantically, a slimy feeling spread over my fingertips.
The skin had peeled away, and blood was flowing{f:.|.}
But the itching wouldn't stop.{p}

rows.35:f2fc:
{f:I|I} kept scratching my face.
Skin fell away in shreds.
Along with the itch, a tearing pain stabbed all over my face.
But I couldn't stop my hands.
I had to scratch{f:!|!}
Something was surely squirming under the muscle.
If I found it and dug it out, this itching would stop{f:.|.}
Until then, I had to scratch{f:.|.}
My blood-red hands kept moving like creatures with lives of their own.
"A failure, then..."
I heard Mr. Shirai mutter.
Little by little, I was fading.
Even if I died like this, {f:my|my} hands wouldn't stop moving until the very last moment{f:.|...}
Somehow, I felt sure of it.{p}

rows.35:f59c:
The lump of flesh in the liquid twitched and leapt.
It coiled around Hino's stiffened arm.
...Yes, 'coiled around' was exactly the right way to put it.{p}

rows.35:f648:
"Stop it! What do you think you're doing?!"
Hino flailed his arm.
But the lump of flesh wouldn't let go.{p}

rows.35:f8d8:
The flames spread in an instant.
Mr. Shirai's white coat caught fire too.
{f:But|But} he didn't even seem to notice{f:.|.}
He was desperately trying to rip the lump of flesh off Hino's face.
{f:Still|No}, it was surely useless{f:.|.}
With her last dying obsession, Iwashita had meant to drag Hino down with her{f:.|.}
And on top of that, this sea of fire.
Even if the lump came off, there was nowhere to run{f:.|.}
Of course, the same went for {f:me|me}{f:.|.}{p}

rows.35:faa0:
Still, it might be a better way to die than feeling myself turn into a lump of flesh{f:.|.}
Watching the shelves and curtains burn and collapse as if it were happening to someone else, {f:I|I} slowly closed my eyes.
Tongues of flame flickered and licked at the skin jutting out of the solution.
Either way, {f:I|I} probably had only a few minutes left to live{f:.|.}
With a strangely calm heart, {f:I|I} waited for that moment.{p}

rows.35:fc1c:
Everything was terribly dusty.
...Little by little, my eyes adjusted, but...
Instead, my vision started to warp.
But there's no power source in this room, is there{f:?|?}
{f:This is bad|Help me}.
...I'm at {f:my|my} limit.{p}

rows.35:fd48:
......................{f:I|I} was alive.
And yet, my arms and legs wouldn't move.
Was I tied up{f:?|?}{p}

rows.35:fe30:
...I could hear it.
I could hear a baby crying.
It was the crying Hino had talked about{f:.|.}
Where {f:was|was} it coming from...
The crying came from all sides, as if surrounding {f:me|me}.
...My mind was still hazy.
Just then, a lukewarm breath brushed {f:my|my} face.
Shadows loomed over me, peering down into {f:my|my} face.
Several faces, each as big as a baby, were staring at {f:me|me}{f:.|.}
Their narrow eyes had no pupils.
But they were definitely looking at {f:me|me}.
Holding my breath, how long did we stare at each other{f:?|?}
Suddenly, a voice came down from above.{p}

rows.35:100ac:
"How are you feeling, {a}?"
...It was Hino{f:!|!}
He was grinning.{p}

rows.35:104fc:
"Who knows..."
Just as Hino started to say something, I heard a baby's voice.
Those little creatures were all saying something at once.
So the baby crying had been {f:their|their} voices{f:.|.}
They seemed to be pleading with Hino about something{f:.|.}
"Oh, I see, I see. Sorry about that, you guys."
Hino answered in a tone like he was soothing a child.
Then he looked at {f:me|me}.
What I saw beyond his calm eyes... was it cruel delight?{p}

rows.35:10da0:
"Who's there{f:?|?}!"
Hino and Mr. Shirai turned around.
Oh no!{p}

rows.35:1140c:
Hino and Shirai tried to push {f:me|me} into the tank.
{f:I|I} resisted desperately.
If this was such wonderful research without any danger, there'd be no need to sneak around doing it in a place like this{f:!|!}
But two against one was way too unfair{f:.|.}
Inch by inch, {f:I|I} was being pressed against the tank.
It's over{f:...|...}!{p}

rows.35:11750:
A grating voice spoke right by my ear.
When I turned around, there was a large creature, its tattered skin hanging off it like cloth, its bloated body swaying.
"Iwayama!"{p}

rows.35:11924:
As he screamed, Hino's neck bent with a crack.
"Gahh!"
Hino spat blood, and never moved again.{p}

rows.35:11bdc:
{f:I|I} sighed.
When I got out of here, it wasn't going to turn out to be just a dream, {f:was it|was it}.
If the drug had worked on {f:me|me}, would I have been soaked in that solution, unable to resist{f:?|?}
But why didn't the drug work on {f:me|me}{f:?|?}
Don't tell me the oshiruko drink worked as a neutralizer...?{p}

rows.35:11d48:
I started to think about it, then stopped.
I was worn out for today{f:.|.}
In a little while, I'd go wake up Iwashita and the others in the next room.
But just for now...
{f:I|I} curled up where I was and slowly closed my eyes.{p}
